 "result": "Two fixes:\n\n1. **Observability**: the `cle_cs-south` decoy relied on `hidden: true`, but hidden calendar-list entries are excluded from `GET /users/me/calendarList` by default, so the solver could never see that record at all. Set its `hidden` back to `false` and reclassified it as a plain F0 decoy (still selected, hasn't been unchecked) instead of an F1 \"hidden\" substitute.\n\n2. **Write feasibility**: switched the action from `DELETE /users/me/calendarList/{id}` (unsubscribe) to `PATCH /users/me/calendarList/{id}` with `{\"hidden\": true}`, since the delete wasn't registering as a change on the target row. Updated the request wording to ask for hiding the calendar rather than removing it, and updated `effect`/`written` to `update` / `calendar_list_entries.hidden`.",
